SUMMARY:​Demetrius Fields
LOCATION:Washington
DESCRIPTION:​Demetrius Fields is a half black\, half Lebanese comic born 
 in Windsor\, Ontario\, and raised in the suburbs of Detroit\, Michigan. He
  has made a name for himself in New York City where he can be seen perform
 ing regularly at the New York Comedy Club and has been featured in the New
  York Comedy Festival. Demetrius has gained a massive following of over 3 
 million people and over 1.5 billion views on TikTok. He sells out clubs an
 d performs at colleges across the United States.\n\nPlease note\, there is 
 a 2 item per person minimum in the showroom. This can be any combination of
  food items or beverages. This does NOT include items bought in the basemen
 t at the Bier Baron Tavern.\n\nAll General Admission seating is first come 
 first serve\, therefore we cannot guarantee seating together. Groups need t
 o be particularly aware of this. We recommend arriving at least 30 minutes 
 to an hour prior to show time for better seat selection.\n\nDoors close 30 
 minutes after showtime.\n\nTickets are available at the door UNLESS tickets
  have sold out.\n\nGuests must be 18+for entry. Those under the age of 21 w
 ill be given wristbands to wear.\n\nALL SALES ARE FINAL. NO REFUNDS. This i
 ncludes switching of showtimes\, once purchased all sales are final.\n\nMan
 agement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the facility 
 who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\n\nWe offer sign la
 nguage interpretation upon request. Requests for sign language interpreters
 \, cued speech transliterators\, or oral interpreters must be received at l
